Emma and Noah grip the flat front flipper of Berta the sea turtle as they swim side by side through the clear shallow surf. Emma has transformed into a mermaid, wearing a long-sleeve blue scaled mermaid top that covers her torso from shoulders to waist and a green mermaid tail ending in a wide flowing tail fin; her wavy brown ponytail drifts in the water and her brown eyes look up with wonder at Berta, while her other fist firmly clutches the palm-sized chunk of frosted blue sea-glass. Noah, a kindergartner boy with wavy ear-length blonde hair, bangs at his eyebrows, and blue eyes, wears a sleeveless orange scaled mermaid top with a band collar covering his torso from shoulders to waist and a blue mermaid tail replacing his legs ending in a broad forked tail fin; his blue eyes are wide with excitement as both hands wrap securely around the flipper. Mottled olive green and brown Berta glides smoothly through the water, her flipper extended straight toward the children. Medium shot beneath the surface of the clear blue coastal water, the pale sandy seabed resting just beneath them.

---METADATA---
