Noah propels himself forward with strong strokes of his broad forked tail fin, swimming straight across the vibrant rocky reef toward the massive silhouette of the sunken wooden ship in the distance. The kindergartner boy wears a sleeveless orange scaled mermaid top and a blue mermaid tail replacing his legs from the waist down, his blonde bangs brushing his forehead as his blue eyes look intently ahead toward the decaying hull. Just behind him, Emma follows along the rocky ridge, swimming on her green mermaid tail while wearing her long-sleeve blue scaled mermaid top, her wavy brown ponytail trailing as her brown eyes track her brother's swift path. Far off in the deeper blue background, Berta the waist-high sea turtle glides in a wide, sweeping arc away from the direct route. Wide shot across the underwater reef, surrounded by large swaying purple sea fans and dense clusters of vibrant red coral growing from the pale sandy seabed.

---METADATA---
