Oskar the octopus curls three of his long tapering reddish-orange arms around the palm-sized wax-sealed envelope, yanking it back into a dark recess between two algae-coated wooden planks. In this close-up shot inside the dark shipwreck hull, Emma floats waist-up in her long-sleeve blue scaled mermaid top, reaching her arm forward with open fingers toward the document. Her brown eyes widen with dismay and her brows pull together as she watches the folded rectangular envelope with its red wax seal slip away into the shadows. Knee-high Oskar retracts his bulbous mantle deeper into the hollow, his large yellow eyes with horizontal pupils blinking playfully and his suction-cup lined arms curling tight around the prize. Green sea growth and small barnacles coat the curved waterlogged timber wall behind them.

---METADATA---
