Alone in the pitch-dark hull of the sunken wooden ship, Emma cups both hands around her open mouth and calls out toward the ceiling timbers. In this close-up shot, the little girl floats waist-up in her long-sleeve blue scaled mermaid top, her wavy brown ponytail drifting gently in the murky black water. Her brown eyes look up with anxious focus, her brows pulled up in strain, and her mouth forms an open shout as she listens for any faint reply from outside. Behind her, the rotting curved wooden planks of the interior hull wall are covered in dense patches of green algae, barnacles, and tiny dark circular gaps that let in no light whatsoever.

---METADATA---
