Emma holds her palm-sized frosted blue sea-glass directly into the incoming orange beam of light, casting a brilliant blue dot that dances wildly across the waterlogged hull planks. The kindergartner girl floats on her green mermaid tail wearing her long-sleeve blue scaled mermaid top, her wavy brown hair swirling around her shoulders and her brown eyes sparkling as her fingers carefully tilt the glass. Nearby on the algae-strewn floor timbers, Oskar the octopus chases the dancing blue dot with all eight reddish-orange arms, entirely abandoning the folded paper envelope that Emma has scooped securely into her other hand. In this medium shot inside the enclosed wooden ship, the warm orange beam cuts dramatically across the dark interior space.

