Mira holds Opa Hans's opened letter flat in her slender hands among the arching red coral formations, laughing with delight as she reads the written words inside. The adult mermaid has a slim build, waist-length wavy sea-green hair worn loose, bright green eyes, a straight nose, a woven top band of purple sea-grass and tiny pink shells across her chest, and a pale teal scaled mermaid tail ending in iridescent pink fins that replaces her legs. Beside her on the fine white sandy seabed, Emma swims gently on her green mermaid tail wearing her long-sleeve blue scaled mermaid top, her brown eyes watching the opened rectangular paper with joyful relief. In this medium shot inside the secluded underwater cove, vibrant pink sea anemones dot the sand beneath their fins under the soft aquatic light.

