Sarah and Daniel kneel on the wide pale yellow beach sand, wrapping Emma and Noah snugly inside the large fringed yellow wool blanket. Sarah, wearing her red wool coat, blue skinny jeans, and black-framed glasses, smiles warmly as her hands draw the yellow wool over Emma's shoulders, while Daniel, dressed in his green quilted autumn jacket and grey chino trousers, wraps the other side around Noah. Emma, back in her purple knitted cardigan and brown corduroy leggings, and Noah, back in his yellow hooded rain jacket and cuffed denim jeans, sit closely bundled together on the sand, their faces glowing in the last warm orange evening light. Farther back along the dunes, elderly Opa Hans stands up from the weathered wooden bench, wearing his orange waxed coat and brown tweed flat cap, waving his arm toward the surf where the mermaid Mira rests waist-up above the gentle rolling waves, her sea-green hair loose as she sings one clear evening note. Ultra-wide shot capturing the entire sweeping shoreline under an orange autumn sky.

